Package: com.legacyfixes.facebook
Name: LegacyFix: Facebook
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Fixes the classic Facebook 11.x app on iOS 6-8. Repairs the broken system Facebook-account integration (privacy_options / me-links / auth.login), spoofs FBAppVersion and FBPlatformVersion in-process (no app-bundle edits), suppresses forced-update alerts and logs diagnostics.
Maintainer: LegacyFixes
Author: LegacyFixes
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 10.0)
